; Regression test for issue #3278: a transaction whose remainder rounds
; to zero at the display precision of its cost commodity was rejected
; when that precision was 0.
;
; The fix for issue #1114 widens a cost commodity of display precision 0
; to the precision of the cost for the balance check, so that a commodity
; seen only in costs, whose precision nothing has taught, does not read a
; sub-unit remainder as zero.  It widened every precision of 0 that way,
; including one that an amount written in the journal had taught.  The
; cost of 12000 IHG @ 0.00008333333333333333333333333333 IHGfreenight is
; 0.99999999999999999999999999996 IHGfreenight, and -1 IHGfreenight
; teaches IHGfreenight a precision of 0, at which the remainder is zero;
; widened to the 32 places of the cost, the check demanded exact equality
; from a price that is a rounded quotient.  The same widening rejected a
; currency without minor units paid through a fractional exchange rate.

; The report's control case: -7.02 USD teaches USD two places, at which
; the remainder of -0.00000000000000000000000000216 USD is zero.
2023-06-15 Test
    Expenses:Gifts     6.48 EUR @ 1.083333333333333333333333333 USD
    Assets:Cash                -7.02 USD

2023-09-25 * IHG free night redemption
    Expenses:Hotels         12000 IHG @ 0.00008333333333333333333333333333 IHGfreenight
    Assets:Rewards          -1 IHGfreenight

; The cost of the card charge is -3000.0636 yen, against 3000 yen.
2024/01/01 Dinner in Tokyo
    Expenses:Food                  ¥3000
    Liabilities:Card          -20.07 USD @ ¥149.48

; Every yen figure here is a cost, so the precision of 0 that the check
; honors is the one the transaction above taught.  The remainder is
; 8123.5 - 8123.4216 = 0.0784 yen.
2024/01/02 Currency exchange
    Assets:Travel:EUR          50.00 EUR @ ¥162.47
    Assets:Travel:USD         -54.33 USD @ ¥149.52

test bal
           50.00 EUR
     -1 IHGfreenight
          -61.35 USD  Assets
           -7.02 USD    Cash
     -1 IHGfreenight    Rewards
           50.00 EUR
          -54.33 USD    Travel
           50.00 EUR      EUR
          -54.33 USD      USD
            6.48 EUR
           12000 IHG
               ¥3000  Expenses
               ¥3000    Food
            6.48 EUR    Gifts
           12000 IHG    Hotels
          -20.07 USD  Liabilities:Card
